  "prefLabel": "Pes 101.04 Chemical liability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 101.04 \"Chemical liability\" means that the insurance coverage required under Pes 301.03 pertains to the handling and use of pesticides.\n\nSource. #4309, eff 9-1-87; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6239, eff 5-2-96",
